        ></div
    ></div
></div>`},"dojo/text!mw-form/templates/ListBox.html":h=>{h.exports='<div data-dojo-attach-point="focusNode"><ul data-dojo-attach-point="containerNode"></ul></div>'},"dojo/text!mw-form/templates/Menu.html":h=>{h.exports=`<div data-dojo-attach-point="focusNode" tabindex="0" role="menu" data-focus="temporary"></div>
`},"dojo/text!mw-form/templates/MenuHeader.html":h=>{h.exports=`<div data-dojo-attach-point="textNode" data-refuse-key-nav="true"></div>
